@DocumentManagement.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5064

### List documents
GET {{DocumentManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Upload a document (replace the file path)
POST {{DocumentManagement.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DocumentBoundary

--DocumentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< C:\path\to\sample.txt
--DocumentBoundary--
